{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1400388-horror-chronicle-inspiration-please-add","id":1400388,"title":"Horror Chronicle Inspiration, Please Add","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-01T13:53:45-07:00","id":1400388,"title":"Horror Chronicle Inspiration, Please Add","content":"I've been working on a list of horror trends. Mostly things that make people feel uneasy without going too far into body horror and torture.<ul><li>The Uncanny Valley<ul><li>Dolls</li> <li>Mannequins</li> <li>Mascot Costumes</li> <li>Animatronics</li> <li>Masks</li> <li>Scarecrows</li> <li>Statues</li> <li>Poor CGI (i.e. 90's/2000's CGI.</li> </ul></li> <li>The Unsettling<ul><li>Plastic Surgery (Facial)</li> <li>Clowns</li> <li>Overly Friendly People</li> </ul></li> <li>Nothing<ul><li>Darkness</li> <li>Feeling of someone behind you</li> <li>Silence</li> <li>Alone</li> </ul></li> <li>Animals<ul><li>Spiders</li> <li>Wolves</li> <li>Cats</li> <li>Coyotes</li> <li>Dogs</li> <li>Reptiles</li> </ul></li> </ul>What would you add as a Horror Trope or something that just scared you.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25291-donteatrawhagis","name":"DontEatRawHagis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25291_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"211"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T13:57:51-07:00","id":1400391,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/HorrorTropes\" target=\"_blank\">These</a> <a href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/FearTropes\" target=\"_blank\">two</a> pages might help you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\" target=\"_blank\">Mystery of Smoke</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1227848-mystery-of-%C5%BEiva-house-rule-revision\" target=\"_blank\">Revised Mystery of \u017diva</a> Mage The Awakening: <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/0B2LMDRtfCcpdZDU1dWJzT1dNeEE/view\" target=\"_blank\">Spell Quick Reference</a> (single page and landscape for computer screens)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11887-tessie","name":"Tessie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11887_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4406"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T14:08:13-07:00","id":1400392,"title":"","content":"To Animals I would probably add sharks and jellyfish, while under either Nothing or The Unsettling could go objects in strange/unexpected places (ie, a door in the middle of an empty field, or a knife in a nursery room, or an elaborately locked box that contains only a single strand of hair).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-01T15:16:59-07:00","id":1400404,"title":"","content":"Betrayal and the breakdown of trust, both in people and in general expectations. Something is out of place and no one around you seems to acknowledge anything is wrong. The world has changed around you in unfair ways. Your closest loved ones' behavior suddenly alters. The floor falls out from under you and what you previously thought was safe and reliable has revealed itself to be something you do not understand.<br /> <br /> Dissonance and confusing signals. Ominous intensity and specificity during a routine action. Danger that is matter-of-fact and silent. A place that is cold in the height of summer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-04T14:01:37-07:00","id":1400997,"title":"","content":"Aside from some excellent examples above, being unable to ask for help even when a large group of people are around or worse, asking for help and being ignored for whatever reason. I think it can be used in a setting with a \u201cmasquerade\u201d quite well\u2014most bystanders won\u2019t believe in the supernatural, won\u2019t have the means to help, or might be unwilling to help what they see as a monster if they\u2019re human (or think they\u2019re helping a \u201cdelusional\u201d human that\u2019s \u201craving\u201d about a supernatural monster by getting them into a hospital/mental hospital. Not knowing who you can trust, if anyone. <br /> <br /> Also natural disasters or sudden accidents can make you feel small or like you have no control over anything. <br /> <br /> Certain sounds (disaster alerts on TVs/phones, sirens, TV static) or music that\u2019s off-key or in minor key when it\u2019s usually in a major key. People crying or screaming. Animals that SOUND like people crying or screaming. People laughing when they shouldn\u2019t be.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>[He who fights monsters might take care lest he thereby become a monster. And if you gaze too long into an abyss, the abyss also gazes into you. -Nietzsche]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26210-kisaragi","name":"kisaragi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}